  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7238f883ca7b304b86f76b5466ed0ba213a79371\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7238f883ca7b304b86f76b5466ed0ba213a79371\" data-origin-width=\"1205\" data-origin-height=\"669\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br>&#129379;먹고나면!&#160;&#127916;보는&#160;즐거움을&#160;느낄&#160;차례입니다!!&#160;^O^ <br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">흩어져&#160;있는&#160;수많은&#160; </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">&#128227;과학&#160;관련&#160;영상&#160;자료&#128227;를&#160;[집단볼성]&#160;으로&#160;모아보려&#160;합니다.</span></b> <br><br>영화,&#160;유튜브,&#160;넷플릭스, TV프로그램~&#160;등&#160;OTT까지&#160;가리지&#160;않습니다!&#160;&#129392; <br><br>짧은&#160;컨텐츠부터&#160;긴&#160;영화까지! <br><br>&#128300;과&#129514;학&#128301;쌤&#129522;들의&#160;찐&#160;추천이라면!! <br>믿고&#160;보는&#160;영상&#128250;이죠!!! <br><br>제목(링크도&#160;가능): <br><b>1.&#160;영상&#160;종류(영화/유튜브/넷플&#160;등):&#160; </b><br><b>2.&#160;영상길이:&#160;약 <br>3. 과학관련분야:</b><br>4<b>.&#160;</b><b>리뷰(난이도,&#160;흥미도&#160;등):&#160;</b> <br><br>패들렛에&#160;미리&#160;위&#160;내용을&#160;넣어놓았습니다.&#160;글&#160;편집해서&#160;입력해주시면&#160;됩니다.&#160; <br><br><a href=\"https://padlet.com/stringweek/mp4\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://padlet.com/stringweek/mp4</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">영상자료가 모두 모이면, 패들렛에서 자료를 옮겨 &#128077;재과만&#128077;에서 바로 보실 수 있게 정리하겠습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"재과만 과학영상 모으기&#9829;\" data-og-description=\"과학쌤들이 찐 추천하는 영상자료!\" data-og-host=\"padlet.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://padlet.com/stringweek/mp4\" data-og-url=\"https://padlet.com/stringweek/mp4\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bl2brZ/hyRfGCHECM/MMgVstfVCqDJHaoBjbWCt1/img.jpg?width=1200